WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.847 --> 00:00:08.717
In this video you'll react to a post, reply to it, and write a post of your own with a photo. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:14.738
Start by opening a group from My Groups. We'll use Classroom Management Ideas.

3
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.190
Each post shows who wrote it, when, how many people reacted, and how many comments it has.

4
00:00:21.692 --> 00:00:26.712
To react, select the thumbs up. Select it again to take your reaction back.

5
00:00:27.212 --> 00:00:34.612
To reply, select the speech bubble to open the comments. Type your reply, then press Enter or select Send.

6
00:00:35.112 --> 00:00:42.512
To write your own post, click in the box at the top and type. Under the box, it says which group the post will go to.

7
00:00:43.012 --> 00:00:56.372
Use the camera to add a photo, the film icon for a video, or the paperclip for a document such as a PDF or a Word file. You can attach up to five files, and each can be up to one hundred megabytes.

8
00:00:56.874 --> 00:01:04.174
If you paste a link to a YouTube or Vimeo video, it plays inside your post. Other web links become clickable.

9
00:01:04.675 --> 00:01:08.795
Select Post. Your post appears at the top of the group's feed.

10
00:01:09.298 --> 00:01:18.398
Every post is checked automatically before it appears. If one is blocked, you'll see a message that says why, and you can reword it and try again.
